        "chunks": [
          {
            "chunk_type": "isnad",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "Muhammad ibn Yahya, from Ahmad ibn Muhammad, from Muhammad ibn Sinan, from Nusayr Abu al-Hakam al-Khath'ami, from Abu 'Abdillah (عليه السلام), who said:",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 23,
            "word_start": 0
          },
          {
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "The believer is of two (types of) believers. So there is a believer who ratified the Covenant of Allah and was loyal to His Stipulation, and that is in the Words of Allah Mighty and Majestic:",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 39,
            "word_start": 23
          },
          {
            "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "[33:23] From the Believers are men who ratified what Covenant Allah Made with them.",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 45,
            "word_start": 39
          },
          {
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "So that is the one who would not be struck by the horrors of the world nor the horrors of the Hereafter, and that is from those who intercede and are not in need of being interceded for.",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 63,
            "word_start": 45
          },
          {
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "And there is a believer like the stalk of the crop — sometimes it bends and sometimes it stands upright. So that is from those who would be struck by the horrors of the world and the horrors of the Hereafter, and that is from those who would be interceded for and who would not (themselves) intercede.",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 88,
            "word_start": 63
          }
        ],
